    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/563145f64466d0b5de04c1f6cc8806ab.avif?t=1742008436\" width=386 height=386 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc94 <strong>&quot;It's not that I can't date; I just won't date just anyone!&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Tesu, a lifelong single simp,a man with zero romantic experience for 30 years. His life is stuck in a monotonous routine, moving between work and home. As time passes, his chances for romance keep slipping away\u2026 and he doesn't even have a friend to set him up on a blind date.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcad &quot;Am I really going to be alone forever\u2026?&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, the lifelong single simp stumbles upon a dating app! Could this be his chance to finally find love? \ud83d\udc98 But things aren\u2019t as easy as he hoped.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83e\udd14 A man with zero dating experience...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/124ada8f593aa8ee0d9061eaff59383a.poster.avif?t=1742008436\" width=360 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/124ada8f593aa8ee0d9061eaff59383a.webm?t=1742008436\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/124ada8f593aa8ee0d9061eaff59383a.mp4?t=1742008436\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has no idea how to start a conversation or what to say. His &quot;dating knowledge&quot; is limited to random posts he\u2019s read online. \ud83d\ude22 On dating apps, he has to win someone over quickly, but with his current abilities, he\u2019s falling short.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udca1 But there\u2019s still hope for him.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/8842f4b282f9980656538f6aff7e49aa.avif?t=1742008436\" width=688 height=386 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cutting-edge AI romance advisor, &quot;Joozy&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joozy connects with you and gives Tesu the best dating advice based on the situation. From smooth flirting, choosing the right topics, making decisions in awkward moments, to pulling off the perfect charm\u2026 But, there's a shocking secret hidden within 'Joozy'...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc49\ud83d\udcf1\u2764\ufe0f &quot;Welcome to the dating app.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can the lifelong single simp follow your advice? Your choices will determine whether he survives the dating jungle or crashes and burns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This might be the biggest challenge of his life, and possibly his last chance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help him level up his romance skills and change his destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to Play]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/4e52324afed5eb6eb03aeb8d4b84775a.avif?t=1742008436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Dating App Interaction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are connected with the lifelong single simp through Joozy. Help him send hearts and match with potential partners on the app! When a match happens, a video call will begin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Choosing Responses</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lifelong single simp will struggle with how to respond during conversations. Your job is to choose the best advice for him. Your choices will determine if he wins her affection or faces rejection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Leveling Up on a Dating App</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lifelong single simp starts at the lowest romance tier\u2014Bronze. Build affection, gain romance points, and help him rise through the tiers, aiming to reach the coveted Gold tier! With your advice, his romance score could soar\u2014or crash terribly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the lifelong single simp reaches Gold tier, a new world of possibilities may open up in front of him.<strong></strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/86d3d4d2f128e86eb6183ca64a63a8b7.avif?t=1742008436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive experience of using a real dating app</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real-time interactions with the lifelong single simp through Joozy's guidance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stories of characters with different charms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The thrill of leveling up a lifelong single simp to the highest dating predator</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3262250/extras/024b7994d0a59f441429a6316eb0b18c.avif?t=1742008436\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you change the course of his desperate life?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience a real-life dating app simulation where your choices matter!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>  <br>\u201cSimp: Leveling Up on a Dating App\u201d</strong></h2>",
